# Typo domain → canonical (301 keeps SEO on michealrayberry.com).
# NOTE: these four are Netlify syntax. Cloudflare Pages matches PATHS only and
# ignores hostname rules, so on Cloudflare the typo domain is redirected by a
# zone-level Single Redirect Rule instead (see AP Setup and Secrets).
https://michaelrayberry.com/* https://michealrayberry.com/:splat 301!
http://michaelrayberry.com/* https://michealrayberry.com/:splat 301!
https://www.michaelrayberry.com/* https://michealrayberry.com/:splat 301!
http://www.michaelrayberry.com/* https://michealrayberry.com/:splat 301!

